  "description": "The youngest daughter of a prestigious noble family disguises herself as a maid and takes on a bodyguard role to repay a debt. In front of her stands a man she has long admired from afar—strong, imposing, and impossible to ignore. As tension simmers between them, a proposal is made: repayment in exchange for personal service. What begins as a transaction slowly entangles them in a dangerous romance filled with power imbalance, desire, and emotional conflict.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3498026285), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13996307), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/AAssi), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/miss_look), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000079710)",
